{"id":"n19945-1-8","stage":4,"title":"고리 · 环","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n19945-1-8-1","ko":"내가 사무실 열쇠를 어디다 두었지?","zh":"我到底把办公室的钥匙放哪儿了啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"사무실","meaning":"办公室","explanation":"사무실：办公室。","readings":[{"term":"사무실","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61202","senseId":"1","lemma":"사무실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사무실","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3"}},{"text":"열쇠를","meaning":"钥匙","explanation":"열쇠：钥匙；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"열쇠","audio":"/audio/5bebbcbf30ba30c05971.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26888","senseId":"1","lemma":"열쇠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열쇠를","audio":"/audio/6c805e651ee45095be5d.mp3"}},{"text":"어디다","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；다：表示放置的位置或在原有内容上添加；与前面的格助词或 데 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디다","audio":"/audio/13876b89fd442a8185f1.mp3"}},{"text":"두었지?","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두었지","audio":"/audio/9d980c4547615c214b6d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"e9425425